 10 am - 4 pm *We may be able to accommodate group tours during weekday hou
 rs. Please inquire within. *Admission is free\, but donations are apprecia
 ted\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/
 boston-fire-museum/79507/
