DESCRIPTION:Take a free tour of the Massachusetts State House! Tours are o
 ffered by the Secretary of the Commonwealth’s office and are led by know
 ledgeable guides. Tours include visits to the Senate and House chambers\, 
 the State Library and many other historic areas of the building. Access to
  the President John F. Kennedy statue outside the front of the building\, 
 which had been barred since September 11\, 2001\, was restored in 2015 and
  is available for viewing April through October. Tours are available weekd
 ays from 10:00AM to 3:30PM and last approximately 30-45 minutes.\n\nSource
 s: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/state-house-t
 ours/85714/
LOCATION:Massachusetts State House\, Massachusetts State House 24 Beacon S
 treet\, Boston\, MA
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/state-house-tours/85714/
END:VEVENT
