 ng illusions\, close-up magic\, and unexpected surprises\, all within the 
 opulent\, storied setting of the historic hotel. There are two 90-minute s
 howtimes every Saturday. VIP magic-and-drink packages with specialty cockt
 ails and food are available. Specialty cocktails include: Vanishing Spell 
 (Grey Goose Vodka\, Cointreau\, blackberry\, lemon\, sparkling rosé\, thy
 me) Rabbit in the Cell (Tequila Ocho Blanco infused with eucalyptus\, rasp
 berry\, green chartreuse\, lime) The Smoke Spell (Dos Hombres Mezcal\, Kno
