DTEND:20250913T020000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:60717ddd16e479c8b3b2c5c23fc72f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Discover Where Marshmallow Fluff Was Created! Join us for a fu
 n foodie adventure in Somerville’s bustling Union Square neighborhood. T
 his unique neighborhood is bursting with culture\, historical significance
 \, and an exciting food scene! Diverse Ethnic Tastes We’ll spend the day
  sampling a diversity of foods from local favorites\, ethnic restaurants\,
  and hand-crafted specialty foods that are sure to wow. Why Choose Off The
  Beaten Path Food Tours? ✓ TripAdvisor Certificate of Excellence winner 
 ✓ 5-star average rating from delighted guests ✓ Local expertise from g
 uides who live and breathe Somerville ✓ 95% of our guests book directly 
 with us for the authentic experience Book now and discover why Union Squar
 e is Boston’s hidden gem\, no gatekeeping!\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEven
 t page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/union-square-somerville-food-tour
 /87291/
LOCATION:Off The Beaten Path Food Tours\, 11 Bow Street\, Somerville\, MA
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/union-square-somerville-food-tour/872
