UID:4f991cd817ff8ca1626cbe2c34878d@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us every 3rd Thursday to tell your stories\, immerse your
 self in the words of others\, play storytelling games\, gain confidence\, 
 and build community. This is a space for Dorchester’s LGBTQIA+ community
  and our allies to come together and cheer each other on! No storytelling 
 or public speaking experience needed to join\; nor is anyone under any obl
 igation to speak. Any human\, regardless of age\, background\, or belief\,
  is welcome here. We embrace diversity and encourage open-mindedness\, und
 erstanding\, and respect for all. Doors open at 6:00 PM and programming is
  from 6:30 PM to 8:00 PM. DotStories is brought to you in partnership by D
 otOUT and JustBook-ish.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.m
