BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sweet & Savory South End Food Tour
DTSTART:20260711T000000
DTEND:20260711T020000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:c062037197495cea97cdce290b31de@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Local Gems of the South End invites you to explore one of Bost
 on's most celebrated food neighborhoods through its flavors\, history\, an
 d vibrant local businesses. Stroll past beautiful Victorian brownstones wh
 ile enjoying generous tastings from beloved independent eateries serving g
 lobally inspired dishes and iconic neighborhood sweets. More than a food t
 our\, this experience introduces you to the chefs\, makers\, and entrepren
 eurs who have helped shape the South End into one of Boston's most excitin
 g culinary destinations. Along the way\, your local guide shares stories o
 f the neighborhood's rich history\, diverse community\, and thriving food 
 scene. Enjoy primarily seated tastings with individual portions\, small gr
 oups (maximum 12 guests)\, a relaxed walking pace\, and plenty of insider 
 recommendations to help you explore the South End like a local. Come hungr
