UID:93e178bba020004b8df3d6b24b48ec@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:How do we keep our most cherished mementos close? Pockets and 
 pouches are objects of migration\; a small fabric purse can carry one's mo
 st sacred objects across countries and through time. Textile Talismans inv
 ites participants to create fabric pouches embellished with diasporic Jewi
 sh textile motifs from the age of Rembrandt. What small\, sentimental thin
 gs might you hold close on your journey? LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS\n\nSourc
 es: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/textile-tali
 smans%3a-printed-pockets/94163/
