DESCRIPTION:Get ready to tap your toes and test your musical knowledge wit
 h Music Bingo every Wednesday from 6pm to 8pm located in CanalSide Food + 
 Drink. The first round starts promptly at 6:30pm. In this exciting twist o
 n traditional bingo\, letters and numbers are replaced with song titles an
 d artists. Players mark off songs on their bingo cards as songs are played
