 ELEMENTS-METAL\, WATER\, WOOD\, FIRE AND EARTH AND THE ORGANS THAT CORRESP
 OND WITH EACH-LUNGS\, KIDNEY\, LIVER\, HEART AND SPLEEN. QIGONG IS AN ANCI
 ENT CHINESE PRACTICE (SIMILAR TO TAI CHI\, BUT MORE FOCUS ON ENERGY CULTIV
 ATION VERSUS TECHNIQUE). EACH CLASS STARTS WITH THE BREATH AND CONNECTING 
 WITH THE PRESENT MOMENT\, STRETCHING\, WARM-UPS\, “FLOWS”\, BALANCE\, 
 MEDITATION AND RELAXATION TECHNIQUES. NO EQUIPMENT IS NEEDED\, PARTICIPANT
 S SHOULD DRESS COMFORTABLY AND BE PREPARED TO ENHANCE THEIR BODY\, MIND\, 
 AND SPIRITUAL CONNECTION.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https:
