DTEND:20261119T000000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:02f28c1b885c183ae91afb26bb54f0@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The premise of the podcast Criminal has always been to tell st
 ories about people "who’ve done wrong\, been wronged\, or gotten caught 
 somewhere in the middle." In this all-new\, intimate\, and darkly funny sh
 ow\, host Phoebe Judge tells those stories about herself and the people sh
 e loves. Growing up in an eccentric\, unpredictable family in Chicago\, Ju
 dge began discovering family secrets. Judge shares how those secrets have 
 shaped her life - including the work she does as a journalist and host of 
 a true crime podcast.\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.mee
 tboston.com/event/an-evening-with-phoebe-judge/93366/
