 arl Herzog will regale you with stories of alcohol aboard Constitution and
  the historical context behind the drinks sailors knew. The USS Constituti
 on Museum is partnering with Privateer Rum\, Boston Harbor Distillery\, an
 d Boston Area Chantey and Maritime Sing for this event. LEARN MORE / GET T
