BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Art of Banksy Exhibit
DTSTART:20261119T000000
DTEND:20270103T000000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:27d2057013574b3a0dbaafe667378f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Come face to face with some of the rarest and most talked-abou
 t art works ever created by Banksy. This limited time exhibit is at The Sa
 unders Castle in Park Plaza\, Nov. 19\, 2026- Jan. 3\, 2027. The Art of Ba
 nksy brings together the world’s largest collection of authenticated Ban
 ksy artworks\, featuring more than 150 original paintings\, prints\, sculp
 tures\, hand-drawn sketches\, and rare works from private collections arou
 nd the globe. Go beyond the iconic street art and discover the creativity
 \, rebellious spirit\, and provocative social commentary that have captiva
 ted audiences and shattered auction records worldwide. Explore remarkable 
 highlights\, including the original Flower Thrower ( Love is in the Air )
 \, created as a personal gift for Banksy’s then-girlfriend\, Leonie Laws
 \, and Banksy’s extraordinary Mona Lisa —a signed\, previously unseen 
 work originally purchased directly from Banksy by Academy Award-winning ac
 tor Brad Pitt and now for the first time on display in Boston! Experience 
 one of the most widely recognizable images created by Banksy\, Girl with B
 alloon . Hear exclusive firsthand stories from those who knew and collabor
 ated with Banksy\, including acclaimed artist Ben Eine\, and get a rare gl
 impse into the creative process behind some of the most recognizable image
 s in contemporary art. Celebrating 10 years of international touring and m
 ore than 1.5 million visitors across four continents\, The Art of Banksy i
 s a rare opportunity to experience the art\, mystery\, and cultural phenom
 enon of an artist who continues to challenge the world. This exhibition is
  not curated or authorized by Banksy. All works are on loan from private c
 ollectors. LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: h
 ttps://www.meetboston.com/event/the-art-of-banksy-exhibit/94333/
LOCATION:Imagine\, The Saunders Castle at Park Plaza 130 Columbus Avenue\,
  Boston\, MA\, 02116
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/the-art-of-banksy-exhibit/94333/
END:VEVENT
