 e experience a curated lineup of Featured Artists bringing their talent\, 
 stories\, and full energy to the stage. Follow us in on Facebook and Insta
 gram @thejuke_wherewemeet to learn more about the artists. At the JUKE\, e
 ach one performs a 15 minute set sharing their artistry. Every JUKE is a l
 ittle different\, and that's part of the fun. The Community Stage Is Open 
