BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bill T. Jones/Arnie Zane Company
DTSTART:20261120T000000
DTEND:20261122T000000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:6ccd879bad7dabd10efb45b6de6e53@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Bill T. Jones/Arnie Zane Company return to the ICA with a 
 program reflecting on history\, legacy\, and continued experimentation. As
  recently announced by New York Live Arts\, the internationally acclaimed 
 Company will bring its 45-year history of performance and touring to a clo
 se in December 2027. This engagement offers Boston audiences one of the fi
 nal opportunities to experience the Company live before its final season. 
 In Collage Revisited \, the full company revisits The History of Collage 
 \, the last collaboration between Bill T. Jones and Arnie Zane before Arni
 e’s death. Originally created in 1988\, the remounting is part of a lega
 cy project for the company — looking back to look forward. The piece rec
 alls the excitement the two artists shared as they set out to reconsider d
 ance spectacle during the 1980s art scene. Collage Revisited blends dance
 \, music\, and spoken word\, exploring themes of identity. Story/ is the l
 atest result of the company’s continued investigation in using John Cage
 ’s Indeterminacy as a choreographic tool. Following the model for the ac
 claimed Story/Time \, the work employs a random menu of movement that is a
 ccompanied by Franz Schubert’s String Quartet No. 14 (Death and the Maid
 en) to craft a conversation between the music and the movement. LEARN MORE
  / GET TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston
 .com/event/bill-t-jones-arnie-zane-company/94272/
LOCATION:Institute of Contemporary Art\, Institute of Contemporary Art 25 
 Harbor Shore Drive\, Boston\, MA\, 02210
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/bill-t-jones-arnie-zane-company/94272
 /
END:VEVENT
