DESCRIPTION:The best songs aren’t always made for the big screen... Tune
  in to Made for TV\, StageWorks’ newest original concert celebrating the
  unforgettable music that came to life on television screens everywhere! F
 rom beloved sitcoms and animated classics to streaming sensations\, made-f
 or-TV movies\, and iconic opening themes\, we're bringing together the son
 gs that made us laugh\, cry\, cheer\, and sing along from the comfort of o
 ur couches. Made for TV isn't just a concert of great music\; it's a celeb
 ration of the moments that had us quoting our favorite characters and coun
 ting down the days until the next episode. Featuring dynamic vocals\, vibr
 ant staging\, and a little nostalgia for every generation this is must-see
 -tv live on stage! 📺 Friday\, November 20 @ 7:30pm 📺 Saturday\, Nove
 mber 21 @ 7:30pm 📺 Sunday\, November 22 @ 3:00pm 📍 The Theatre at St
 . Bernard's High School 45 Harvard Street | Fitchburg\, MA\n\nSources: Dis
 cover Central Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org
 /event/made-for-tv%3a-songs-that-stole-the-show/31304/
