BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Miracle® Pop-Up Bar
DTSTART:20261120T000000
DTEND:20261230T000000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:03917bb937bc6b074d27ed688e7c42@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Holiday cheer is on the menu once again as the beloved and alw
 ays popular Christmas pop-up bar\, Miracle\, returns to Kimpton Marlowe Ho
 tel for its ninth exciting year. Recognized for transforming cocktail hot 
 spots across the US into immersive holiday-themed destinations\, this year
 ’s Marlowe pop-up invites guests to deck the halls with over-the-top dec
 orations while rocking out with a 6ft. Santa Claus and sipping on a select
 ion of original\, holiday-themed libations. Miracle at Kimpton Marlowe is 
 all excited to unwrap a selection of new cocktails for 2026 that are packe
 d with bold flavors\, creative twists and plenty of spirit. New additions 
 include the Sugarplum Stampede\, Christmas Cricket\, Sleigh-Saurus and Mer
 ry Mouse-Tail. Repeat fan favorites like the Christmapolitan\, Snowball Ol
 d-Fashioned\, Koala LaLaLa\, Run Run Reindeer\, Rudolph’s Replacement an
 d Jingle Balls Nog are back on the menu as well. While Nice and Naughty sh
 ots are back too\, new non-alcoholic options include the Ginger Bell Rock 
 and Tinsel & Tart. A hallmark of the Miracle experience and tradition\, ex
 clusive limited-edition glassware is available for purchase and it’s as 
 giftable\, collectible and beloved as ever. This year’s lineup features 
 signature beverages served in a variety of mugs including Santa’s Head\,
  a SanTaRex\, a Unicorn and Mouse. These cheerful spirits can be consumed 
 under twinkling lights and strands of never-ending garland while a marble 
 fireplace crackles in the background to warm your winter evenings. Miracle
  at Marlowe is all aglow with ornaments hanging from the ceiling while cat
 chy Christmas tunes provide the perfect holiday soundtrack to immediately 
 fill guests with merriment. Delicious light bites courtesy of Bambara Kitc
 hen and Bar are offered as well. Miracle is the ultimate holiday tradition
  that’s sure to get even the Grouchiest Grinch in the holiday spirit!\n
 \nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/mirac
 le%c2%ae-pop-up-bar/94130/
LOCATION:Kimpton Marlowe Hotel\, 25 Edwin Land Boulevard\, Cambridge\, MA
 \, 02141
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/miracle%c2%ae-pop-up-bar/94130/
END:VEVENT
