 ttable event pass you by! At this event like no other\, you’ll play alon
 g as a detective or play a part as a suspect in the crime. Work with other
  guests to crack the case over a mouthwatering three-course meal\, and dis
 cover whodunnit before the killer gets away! Mingle and connect with other
  teams and intriguing suspects\, discover clues\, uncover shocking secrets
 \, and unleash your inner child’s imagination during this interactive co
 medic experience. But watch out! The killer could be anyone… even YOU! P
 articipate in a new mystery every month! From the glitz of 1930s Hollywood
  in “Best Laid Plans” to the roaring 1920s with “Death of a Gangster
 \,” each event offers unforgettable thrills. Boogie at a 1950s sock hop
 \, solve a 90s crime in “Good Riddance\,” or celebrate the season with
  “The Most Wonderful Crime of the Year.” Whether it's a billionaire’
 s masquerade\, a 1980s bash\, or a chilling wedding-themed whodunit\, ther
 e’s a unique mystery waiting for you. Mark your calendar and join the fu
 n at Dorchester Brewing Co in Dorchester! Call the Box Office to avoid fee
 s and get $9 off! 888-659-2952 LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet B
 oston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/murder-mystery-co-dinn
 er-theater-show/92204/
