DESCRIPTION:Just in time for the holidays! Kick off the season with a vibr
 ant celebration of American ingenuity. As the season’s most anticipated 
 creative showcase\, Paradise City Arts brings together a curated collectio
 n of 175 artists + makers from across the country. Discover a world of bes
 poke fashion\, one-of-a-kind jewelry\, and visionary home décor. Beyond t
 he gallery-style displays\, this show transforms the traditional fair into
  a sensory experience. Wander through aisles of unparalleled craftsmanship
  while enjoying live demonstrations that reveal the magic of the process
 – from the meticulous rhythm of the loom\, to the transformation of raw 
 clay and the art of hand-painted silk. This is your invitation to engage w
 ith the creators\, uncover the stories behind the work\, and acquire the s
 eason’s most coveted original pieces. With live demonstrations\, two caf
 es\, and creative activities for the whole family!\n\nSources: Discover Ce
 ntral Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/p
 aradise-city-arts/31173/
