UID:3a21900d5d08b0e558ac4d1d196bf1@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:For our Fall Film Frolic\, we have assembled a 3 pack of inter
 national films that puts the focus on shedding dark secrets and toxic mind
 sets\, giving us room to play in our true selves and connect to our commun
 ities. We celebrate the dark comedy of a journey of self discovery in a to
 xic world (Castration Movie 3.2)\, discovering the personal power in a rev
 elation of a family secret. (In A Whisper) and a personal history of findi
 ng community and self-love in the golden age of porn (Mickey and Richard).
  Babe\, the old world is falling\, let the frolic begin… LEARN MORE / GE
 T TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/
