DESCRIPTION:Illuminate the winter season at Southwick’s Zoo’s annual w
 alk-through holiday lights festival – Winter Wonderland! When is Winter 
 Wonderland? Winter Wonderland runs Fridays through Sundays and select week
 days from November 20\, 2026 to January 3\, 2027\, 5:00 PM - 9:00 PM. *** 
 Winter Wonderland will be closed on Christmas Day\, December 25\, 2026 and
  New Year’s Day\, January 1\, 2027\, and will close at 7:30 PM on Christ
 mas Eve and New Year's Eve. What is Winter Wonderland? Winter Wonderland i
 s a one-of-a-kind winter holiday festival featuring over 4 million dazzlin
 g lights\, nightly shows and entertainment\, seasonal sips and snacks\, vi
 sits from holiday characters\, and everything in between to light up the m
 ost magical time of the year. Winter Wonderland Event Highlights A premier
  holiday lights display featuring millions of dazzling holiday lights\, la
 rger-than-life displays\, sparkling light tunnels\, and glowing decoration
 s. Live shows & entertainment all night long with nightly live stage shows
  from the Ice Queens and Friends\, and juggler variety shows. Meet & greet
 s with Santa Claus at Santa’s barn\, where you can share holiday wishes 
 and grab photos (November 20 - December 24 only). Meet & greets with the G
 rinch in Whoville (December 26 - January 3 only). Family-friendly animal a
 ttractions at the Petting Zoo and Rainforest Room. Carousel rides under th
 e winter lights in our indoor\, temperature-controlled carousel room. Seas
 onal treats and sips such as holiday cookies\, pretzels\, spiked hot cocoa
 \, and s’mores at our cozy fire pits. Holiday shopping at the Purple Pea
 cock Gift Shop featuring a treasure trove of soft plushes\, souvenirs\, ap
 parel\, and unique gifts you can’t find anywhere else. PLUS\, free gift 
 wrapping all season long. Pricing: Admission Purchased at the Gate: Adults
  $25 | Children (3-12) $15 Admission Purchase Online: Adults $23 | Childre
 n (3-12) $23 Children under 2: Free Click here to purchase tickets. For mo
 re information visit southwickszoo.com/winter-wonderland\n\nSources: Disco
 ver Central Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/e
 vent/winter-wonderland/31314/
LOCATION:Southwick's Zoo\, 2 Southwick St.\, Mendon\, MA\, 01756
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/winter-wonderland/31314/
END:VEVENT
