SUMMARY:Grinch\, Leif\, Santa\, or Sven Workshop
DTSTART:20261121T000000
DTEND:20261121T000000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:85fefdb1503fb0a1704a36ba9e3f1a@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:All four of these extremely cool decorations have similar cons
 truction techniques. So we teach them together at the same time. Simply ch
 oose the one that appeals to you from the drop-down menu. Grinch Tree - Bu
 ild a whimsical\, bent-top evergreen Grinch Tree on a tomato cage and deco
 rate it with colorful holiday accents. Finished project is about 3 feet ta
 ll\; leave room in your car! Leif - Meet Leif\, the red-capped cousin of m
 oss-hatted Sven! Create an evergreen gnome with a cheerful red cap\, match
 ing mittens\, and a prominent nose. Built on a tomato cage and about 3 fee
 t tall. Santa - Turn fresh evergreen branches into a jolly Santa with a re
 d hat and a pale\, flowing beard. Built on a tomato cage and about 3 feet 
 tall\; leave room in your car! Sven - Inspired by the tomte of Nordic folk
 lore\, Sven combines fragrant evergreens with a woodland moss cap and a sh
 aggy beard. Built on a tomato cage and about 3 feet tall. Preregistration 
 required. Includes all materials and instruction.\n\nSources: Discover Cen
 tral Massachusetts\nEvent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/gr
 inch-leif-santa-or-sven-workshop/31203/
LOCATION:Bemis Farms Nursery\, 29 North Brookfield Rd 29 North Brookfield 
 Rd\, Spencer\, MA\, 01562-1303
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/grinch-leif-santa-or-sven-work
 shop/31203/
END:VEVENT
