DESCRIPTION:Armed with the unique perspective of growing up in rural Idaho
  to become a favorite in the New York stand-up comedy scene\, Ryan is one-
 of-a-kind. With two Netflix specials\, Happy Face and his latest\, This Ju
 st Hit Me \, plus numerous late-night television appearances\, including a
 s a regular guest on The Tonight Show with Jimmy Fallon\, he's garnered a 
 following of loyal fans. They've turned out for sold-out theaters and aren
 as across the country\, including a headlining show at the Delta Center in
  Salt Lake City\, Utah. At the same time\, he's had the unique privilege o
 f serving as a frequent opener for two of the largest touring comedy acts 
 in the country\, both Jerry Seinfeld and Nate Bargatze. Ryan is beloved by
  stand-up fans everywhere\, and his future is bright. The New York Times s
 aid\, "his new hour a breakthrough\,” and praised his ability to tell "g
 reat observational jokes that display meticulous attention to language and
  a gift for making the familiar seem alien.” LEARN MORE / GET TICKETS\n
 \nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/ryan-
 hamilton/91944/
