BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Traitors & Hunters | Murder at The Mansion
DTSTART:20261121T000000
DTEND:20261121T000000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:f71d88502702839688236e393f252e@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:A thrilling interactive mystery blending puzzles\, deception\,
  and roleplay as guests hunt traitors throughout Endicott House. A Signatu
 re Interactive Mystery Experience at the MIT Endicott House The concept co
 mbines the intrigue of The Traitors \, the excitement of an escape room\, 
 and the immersive storytelling of a live murder mystery. Guests become act
 ive participants in a high-stakes game of deception\, deduction\, and betr
 ayal set throughout the historic Endicott House. The Story On the night of
  his will reading\, wealthy businessman Edison Endicott’s heirs gather a
 t the mansion only to discover that he was murdered by a secret cabal of t
 raitors. Before his death\, Endicott devised one final challenge: if the t
 raitors can evade detection and eliminate their opponents\, they inherit h
 is fortune. If the hunters uncover them first\, justice prevails and the f
 ortune is shared among the innocent. Guest Experience Upon arrival\, every
  guest secretly receives a role as either a Hunter or a Traitor. Throughou
 t the evening\, guests move throughout the mansion solving puzzles\, uncov
 ering clues\, questioning eccentric characters\, completing challenges\, a
 nd attempting to identify the traitors hiding among them.The experience en
 courages: Teamwork and social interaction Exploration of the mansion Frien
 dly competition Strategic thinking Immersive roleplay As the evening unfol
 ds\, accusations are made\, alliances form and break\, and players may be 
 “murdered” and return as ghosts who continue influencing the game. The
  final act culminates in a dramatic roundtable where guests vote on who th
 ey believe the traitors are before the ultimate reveal. The Mansion as a C
 haracter Unlike a traditional murder mystery dinner\, Endicott House itsel
 f becomes part of the experience. Different rooms host unique characters\,
  clues\, and challenges\, encouraging guests to explore the property while
  becoming immersed in the story. Menu Sample buffet style menu as follows 
 (subject to change): Harlequin Salad with Champagne Vinaigrette Carved Fru
 it Ambrosia Pickled Beet Salad Waldorf Salad Assorted Dinner Rolls with Ch
 urned Butter Honey Glazed Carrots with Roasted Brussel Sprouts Baked Chedd
 ar & Chive Duchess Potato Spun Capellini Nest with Vodka Arrabbiata Dirty 
 Martini Salmon (Salmon with Olive\, Tomatoes\, Capers Vermouth & Gin) Carv
 ed Horseradish Beef w/ Au Jus White Chocolate Tuxedo Cake LEARN MORE / GET
  TICKETS\n\nSources: Meet Boston\nEvent page: https://www.meetboston.com/e
 vent/traitors-%26-hunters-%7c-murder-at-the-mansion/93513/
LOCATION:TeamBonding\, MIT Endicott House 80 Haven Street\, Dedham\, MA\, 
 02026
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/traitors-%26-hunters-%7c-murder-at-th
 e-mansion/93513/
END:VEVENT
