DESCRIPTION:Support education for refugees in Myanmar! FEATURING ORIGINAL 
 ARTISTS IN THE BOSTON / NY AREA Scrambling to find an internet connection
 \, studying as bomber planes fly overhead\, rebuilding a classroom that wa
 s bombed just last week. This is what a school day for a Karen student in 
 refugee camps along the Thai-Myanmar border could look like. Yet\, student
 s and teachers prevail. Resilience deserves support. From helping with rep
 airs\, classroom materials\, and support for teachers\, your generosity wi
 ll go far. Ticket proceeds go towards schools in Karen State\, Myanmar and
  schools along the Thailand-Myanmar border 🏫 🎤 hosts: @karingfrontie
 rs & @nomadic_voices 🥁 line up 🎸 @lasyatmusic @kay.tear Arjawn & Cah
