DESCRIPTION:On Sunday\, November 22 at 4pm\, Waquoit Congregational Church
  hosts a screening and discussion of Matters of Mind: My Alzheimer’s. Th
 e film is an intimate portrayal of three diverse families confronting the 
 complexities and challenges of Alzheimer’s and dementia related disease.
  Anchored by deeply loving bonds\, a son helps his father create art throu
 gh dementia\, a daughter cares for her mother who has early-onset Alzheime
 r’s\, and a couple struggles to maintain their fragile equilibrium as sy
 mptoms advance. After the film\, Dr. Molly Purdue and Malanie Braverman\, 
 Co-Founders of Alzheimer’s Family Support Center (AFSC) Cape Cod will le
 a\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org
