BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Chatham Turkey Trot
DTSTART:20261126T000000
DTEND:20261126T000000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:bb7f594038a881a50c4b6c822833eb@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Chatham Turkey Trot is a beloved Cape Cod Thanksgiving tra
 dition\, bringing thousands of runners\, walkers and spectators together f
 or a festive 5K through scenic Chatham. Held Thanksgiving morning\, the fa
 mily-friendly event is a fun way to get moving before the holiday feast wh
 ile giving back to the community\, with proceeds benefiting the Lower Cape
  Outreach Council\, which helps local families in need. Whether you run\, 
 walk or cheer from the sidelines\, it’s a wonderful way to kick off Than
 ksgiving with a little exercise\, community spirit and Cape Cod charm! For
  registration\, course details and the latest race-day information\, visit
  the official Chatham Turkey Trot website.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nE
 vent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/chatham-turkey-trot/52648/
