 andcrafted gifts\, holiday shopping\, seasonal treats\, live entertainment
 \, and Christmas cheer. Whether you’re starting your holiday shopping or
  creating a new family tradition\, you’ll discover the very best of Cape
  Cod’s local makers and small businesses. Shop unique handcrafted gifts 
 from talented local artisans Support Cape Cod small businesses Find beauti
 ful holiday décor and one-of-a-kind treasures Enjoy festive food\, warm b
 everages\, and seasonal favorites Experience live holiday entertainment th
 roughout the market Visit with Santa and enjoy fun activities for the whol
 e family Help support our annual community food drive benefiting local fam
 ilies There’s nothing quite like the sights\, sounds\, and spirit of Chr
 istmas at the Cape Cod Christmas Market. Gather your family and friends an
 d enjoy a festive shopping experience filled with holiday magic. Market Da
 tes Friday\, November 27 | 11:00 AM-2:00 PM Saturday\, November 28 | 11:00
  AM-2:00 PM Sunday\, November 29 | 11:00 AM-2:00 PM Saturday\, December 12
  | 11:00 AM-2:00 PM Location Naukabout Beer Garden\, 4 Job’s Fishing Roa
 d\, Mashpee\, MA Admission is FREE! Shop local. Celebrate the season. Crea
 te lasting memories. For vendor applications\, sponsorship opportunities\,
  and additional event information\, visit CapeCodChristmasMarket.com.\n\nS
 ources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event
 /cape-cod-christmas-market/52822/
LOCATION:Lemonadio\, Mashpee\, MA
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/cape-cod-christmas-market/52822/
