BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Newburyport Art presents the Miniatures & Making Time Exhibitions
DTSTART:20261127T110000
DTEND:20261127T170000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:a854a03e122655e055110c2de78075@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Newburyport Art (NAA) is pleased to announce two new shows on 
 view for the month of November. Miniatures features over 100 artworks that
  celebrate the unique possibilities of working on an intimate scale. All a
 rtworks measure 36 square inches and smaller\, and include painting\, draw
 ing\, printmaking\, photography\, fiber\, ceramics\, sculpture\, mixed med
 ia\, and other contemporary practices. Whether highly detailed or boldly m
 inimalist\, representational or abstract\, each piece demonstrates how a s
 mall format can create a powerful visual experience. This exhibition honor
 s the enduring tradition of miniature art while showcasing the creativity
 \, craftsmanship\, and innovation of today’s artists\, proving that grea
 t art is not measured by size\, but by its ability to captivate\, inspire
 \, and endure. On view alongside Miniatures is Marking Time\, an exhibitio
 n by Paula Edwards Borsetti & Nancy Cloonan. Both artists paint intuitivel
 y\, letting the work reveal what they carry\, remember\, and return to. Tr
 ansparent and opaque layers build up\, color and line respond to one anoth
 er\, and instinct guides each decision. Each painting holds what accumulat
 ed in the making: a record of time\, marked. The galleries are free and op
 en to the public Wednesday through Sunday from 11:00am–5:00pm. Newburypo
 rt Art is closed on Mondays and Tuesdays. The first-floor galleries are ha
 ndicap accessible. More information\, as well as an online gallery\, visit
  newburyportart.org.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://nort
 hofboston.org/event/newburyport-art-presents-the-miniatures-making-time-ex
 hibitions/2026-11-27/
LOCATION:Newburyport Art Association\, 65 Water St\, Newburyport\, MA\, 01
 950
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/newburyport-art-presents-the-miniature
 s-making-time-exhibitions/2026-11-27/
END:VEVENT
