UID:1e78ba19cd8e938e78525d3462995c@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Welcome winter with a little warmth\, creativity\, and holiday
  magic! ❄️🕯️ Celebrate the Winter Solstice at Wenham Museum as we
  welcome the return of longer days! Sip on warm spiced cider\, make wishes
  for the new year\, and get creative with seasonal crafts. 🌿 Create you
 r own citrus pomander or mini winter wreath\, try your hand at candle maki
 ng\, and step inside the Claflin House to enjoy the cozy glow of candlelig
 ht and a traditional Yule log. Then let your imagination run wild with sto
 rytelling and shadow puppet play! Gather your family and friends for a fes
 tive afternoon filled with seasonal traditions\, hands-on fun\, and commun
 ity! 🎁 BONUS: Museum admission AND program admission are FREE from 4–
 6 PM! This special program is presented in partnership with Early Childhoo
 d Partners CFCE and generously sponsored by Tru North Bank. Thank you for 
 helping us bring this seasonal celebration to our community! We can’t wa
 it to celebrate with you! #WenhamMuseum #WinterSolstice #NorthShoreMA #Fam
 ilyFun #WinterTraditions #HolidayActivities Welcome winter with a little w
 armth\, creativity\, and holiday magic! ❄️🕯️ Celebrate the Winter
  Solstice at Wenham Museum as we welcome the return of longer days! Sip on
  warm spiced cider\, make wishes for the new year\, and get creative with 
 seasonal crafts. 🌿 Create your own citrus pomander or mini winter wreat
 h\, try your hand at candle making\, and step inside the Claflin House to 
 enjoy the cozy glow of candlelight and a traditional Yule log. Then let yo
 ur imagination run wild with storytelling and shadow puppet play! Gather y
 our family and friends for a festive afternoon filled with seasonal tradit
 ions\, hands-on fun\, and community! Museum admission is FREE from 4–6 P
 M! This special program is presented in partnership with Early Childhood P
 artners CFCE and generously sponsored by Tru North Bank. Thank you for hel
 ping us bring this seasonal celebration to our community! We can’t wait 
 to celebrate with you.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: https://no
 rthofboston.org/event/free-first-wednesday-winter-solstice-celebration/
LOCATION:Wenham Museum\, 132 Main St.\, Route 1A\, Wenham\, MA\, 01984
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/free-first-wednesday-winter-solstice-c
 elebration/
