BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hanukkah Dinner at Baleine
DTSTART:20261202T000000
DTEND:20261202T000000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:25a8ce2b519170e8251a7fa2fe3660@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Baleine on Wednesday\, December 2 to celebrate Hanu
 kkah with a five-course dinner inspired by the classics of the holiday tab
 le\, with each course paired with a beverage chosen to go alongside it. We
 'll start with a comforting bowl of matzo ball soup with poached chicken\,
  a soft egg\, crispy shallot\, parsnip and dill. Next come crispy latkes t
 opped with crème fraîche\, trout roe and apple relish\, followed by chop
 ped liver with caramelized onion jam\, gribenes and schmaltz. The main cou
 rse is brisket with a "Lipton" soubise\, noodle kugel\, glazed carrots and
  horseradish. And of course\, we'll finish with sufganiyot filled with ras
 pberry jam. Dinner begins at 6PM. $65 per person plus tax and gratuity inc
 ludes all five courses and beverage pairings. Seating is limited to 40 gue
 sts\, and tickets are available until 6PM on Tuesday\, December 1. SAMPLE 
 MENU Amuse | Matzo Ball Soup\, poached chicken\, soft egg\, crispy shallot
 \, parsnip\, dill Latkes | crème fraîche\, trout roe\, apple relish Chop
 ped Liver | caramelized onion jam\, gribenes\, schmaltz Brisket | "Lipton"
  soubise\, noodle kugel\, glazed carrot\, horseradish Sufganiyot | raspber
 ry jam\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchambe
 r.org/event/hanukkah-dinner-at-baleine/52775/
LOCATION:Baleine 776 Main Street Dennis\, Baleine 776 Main Street Dennis
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/hanukkah-dinner-at-baleine/52775/
END:VEVENT
