DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 29th annual Holly Folly Festival! For the seco
 nd year\, Holly Folly expands from one weekend to all four weekends in Dec
 ember! The nation’s largest and oldest LGBTQ+ Holiday Celebration\, Holl
 y Folly\, first began in 1997 as an opportunity to gather and celebrate th
 e Holiday season with our chosen family in Provincetown. Today\, the queer
  community travels from far and wide to enjoy great performance art\, fine
  dining\, and holiday shopping experiences from the truly unique shops\, b
 outiques\, and galleries that line Commercial Street.\n\nSources: Cape Cod
