DESCRIPTION:Stroll into the season at the Falmouth Village Holiday Stroll
 \, presented by the Falmouth Village Association as part of Holidays by th
 e Sea Weekend. Enjoy an evening of seasonal shopping\, live entertainment
 \, and community celebration in the heart of Falmouth Village. Visit Santa
  at Barbo’s Furniture (4:00PM to 5:45PM). Over at Peg Noonan Park\, you
 ’ll find a live ice sculpture by South Cape Ice (4:00PM to 8:00PM)\, the
  Cape Cod Photo Bus (4:00PM to 6:00PM)\, and the new Holiday Market (3:00P
 M to 8:00PM). Visitors can enjoy food trucks\, carolers\, live music\, lin
 e dancing\, dance performances\, face painting\, cookies\, cocoa\, and ple
 nty of family-friendly activities\, along with special offers and treats f
 rom participating local shops. At 5:45PM\, Santa will lead everyone down M
 ain Street to the Village Green\, accompanied by the FHS Choir\, followed 
 by the traditional Lighting of the Village Green at 6:00 PM. Free parking 
 will be available at the Steamship Authority Palmer Avenue parking lot unt
 il 10:00PM. Parking is also available at downtown municipal lots\, Mullen 
 Hall School\, and Lawrence School. For updates and details\, follow IG and
  FB @falmouthvillagema\, or visit falmouthvillageassociation.com\n\nSource
 s: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/falm
 outh-village-holiday-stroll/51881/
