DTSTART:20261205T000000
DTEND:20261219T000000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:7058430e663226fca4969aa5e4dbb2@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:“Made with Love”! Three unique crafts to treat yourself an
 d surprise your loved ones! These workshops are a wonderful multigeneratio
 nal opportunity to gather\, create\, and take home two handmade treasures:
  one to keep\, and one to give as a gift. No experience is needed\, and al
 l materials and guidance are provided. Whether you come with a grandchild
 \, a friend\, a neighbor\, or on your own\, you’ll leave with something 
 you’re proud of and a gift that carries a little piece of you. Workshop 
 1: Seashell Decoupage Ornament\, Saturday\, December 5 at 11 a.m. Workshop
  2: Winter Watercolor Card\, Saturday\, December 12 at 11 a.m. Workshop 3:
  Hoop Earrings\, Saturday\, December 19 at 11 a.m.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Ch
 amber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/made-with-love-a-t
 hree-part-craft-workshop-series/52764/
LOCATION:West Falmouth Library\, 575 West Falmouth Highway\, West Falmouth
 \, MA\, 02540
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/made-with-love-a-three-part-craft
 -workshop-series/52764/
