SUMMARY:Beverly Main Streets Holiday Stroll on Cabot Street
DTSTART:20261211T160000
DTEND:20261211T200000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:42951530fc9304c00a8085c180454e@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:The Downtown Beverly Holiday Stroll returns on December 11 and
  12\, 2026! The annual Downtown Holiday Stroll is back again! On Friday\, 
 12/11 we will celebrate the businesses on Cabot St and adjacent streets\, 
 and on Saturday\, 12/12 we will celebrate the businesses on Rantoul St and
  adjacent streets. Both nights will run from 4 – 8 PM. We are looking fo
 r artists\, makers\, and vendors to participate in our annual market in th
 e basement of The Bower\, as well as local downtown brick-and-mortar busin
 esses to stay open late and be merry! INFO & APPLICATION FOR BUSINESSES: A
 re you a brick-and-mortar business within the downtown district who wishes
  to be added as a stop for those attending the event? Use this application
  here! With participation in this event\, we are encouraging businesses to
  also light up their storefronts and sidewalks to make everything as festi
 ve\, merry\, and bright as possible! If you are able\, we hope you’ll ha
 ve twinkly lights\, garlands\, or maybe even seasonal inflatables to reall
 y show the spirit of the season. INFO & APPLICATION FOR VENDORS / ARTISTS 
 / MAKERS: We are looking for vendors (think artists\, creators\, makers\, 
 bakers\, etc) for our market at The Bower on Friday\, December 11th from 4
 -8 pm (note that there may be opportunity for an additional market on Satu
 rday\, December 12th – TBD). This market is not intended for promotional
  tabling by companies or organizations. If this sounds like you\, please s
 ubmit your application here! Applications will be reviewed by our Promotio
 ns Committee. Submitting an application does not guarantee participation i
 n the event\, but early application is helpful. Please note that any AI ge
 nerated images will not be considered. Vendors not selected in the first r
 ound will be placed on a waitlist and contacted if space becomes available
  (or if another market opportunity arises). The vendor fee for participati
 on begins at $50 and will increase to $75 for any applications submitted o
 n 11/8 or later. Apply now to lock in your reduced vendor fee! Payment wil
 l be required within 1 week of acceptance. Those accepted will be given ro
 ughly 8 feet of space to set up — enough room for a 6 foot table with sp
 ace in between. Accepted vendors are required to bring their own table and
  chairs. The application deadline is 11/17 The Bower is an ADA compliant b
 uilding with both stairs and elevator to the basement.\n\nSources: North o
 f Boston\nEvent page: https://northofboston.org/event/beverly-main-streets
 -holiday-stroll-on-cabot-street/
LOCATION:Cabot Street\, Cabot Street\, Beverly\, 01915
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/beverly-main-streets-holiday-stroll-on
 -cabot-street/
END:VEVENT
