DTSTART:20261211T000000
DTEND:20261211T000000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:5fbfedf6a51643b103f38915d957f8@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:We welcome back to Chatham Bars Inn\; Trish LaRose and Joe Mer
 rick for an intimate evening of live music. After a successful summer at t
 he Cotuit Center for the Arts performing in Let’s Dance: A Tribute to th
 e 80's\, and a sold out Women Rock concert at the Cape Cod Melody Tent\, t
 his dynamic duo is ready for the holiday season. With their powerhouse voc
 als and heartfelt presentation\, Joe and Trish blend their talents and har
 monies effortlessly to create a joyful evening that's not to be missed! Ti
 ckets are $50 per person and include one drink\, holiday cookies and acces
 s to a lite bite menu for sale. Open to the public as well as guests and m
 embers. Reservations can be made through our concierge at 508-945-6871 or 
 on Eventbrite. Standard Eventbrite fee applies. Full refunds are offered f
 or cancellations received 2 days prior to the event\, cancellations receiv
 ed less than 48 hours will be charged 100%.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\n
 Event page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/holiday-music-show-joe-me
 rrick-%26-trish-larose/52614/
LOCATION:Chatham Bars Inn\, 297 Shore Road\, Chatham\, MA\, 02633
URL:https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/holiday-music-show-joe-merrick-%2
 6-trish-larose/52614/
