 ar and Booze Holiday Spectacular. Beloved for her work on Saturday Night L
 ive and her Broadway performances\, Ana Gasteyer delivers an evening of da
 zzling vocals\, sophisticated humor\, and festive charm. Blending holiday 
 classics\, jazz-infused favorites\, and sparkling storytelling\, this excl
 usive Cape Symphony Presents event is a joyful and elegant celebration of 
 the season—perfect for sharing with family\, friends\, and everyone on y
 our holiday list.\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.ca
