BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Haley Heynderickx
DTSTART:20261212T193000
DTEND:20261212T210000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:5afc479906210b270c81345f4f148b@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Following the release of her acclaimed debut I Need to Start a
  Garden and its long-awaited follow-up Seed of a Seed\, Haley Heynderickx 
 recently released What of Our Nature\, a collaboration with Max García Co
 nover. After a year of touring with Max and working on new material\, she 
 now returns to the road for a rare run of solo performances. One of contem
 porary folk’s most quietly captivating voices\, Heynderickx writes with 
 warmth\, wit and self-reflection. Her songs find wonder in the everyday wh
 ile exploring questions of identity\, belonging and our relationship with 
 the natural world. Tender\, thoughtful and quietly spellbinding\, these sh
 ows are an invitation to step into the unknown with her and leave a little
  room for what may come next.\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page: htt
 ps://northofboston.org/event/haley-heynderickx/
LOCATION:Shalin Liu Performance Center\, 37 Main Street\, Rockport\, MA\, 
 01966
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/haley-heynderickx/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Historic Beverly Annual Holiday House Tour
DTSTART:20261212T110000
DTEND:20261212T150000
DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:f17e81e90ae573e1190bbcbf19592f@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:It’s the Most Wonderful Tour of the Year! Beverly’s favori
 te holiday tradition is back and it’s bigger\, merrier\, and more magica
 l than ever! Grab your friends\, bundle up\, and get ready to step inside 
 some of Beverly’s most beautiful private homes\, decked out in their hol
 iday finest. The Annual Historic Beverly Holiday House Tour invites you to
  experience the season through seven stunning homes\, each with its own un
 ique character\, history\, and holiday sparkle. From twinkling lights and 
 festive decorations to historic architecture and those special little touc
 hes that make a house feel like home\, there’s something delightful wait
 ing behind every door. So put on your coziest scarf\, lace up your walking
  shoes\, and make a day of it! Wander through Beverly\, soak up the holida
 y spirit\, and discover the stories\, both old and new\, that make our com
 munity so special. Seven homes. Four centuries of history. One very merry 
 Beverly tradition. And if you’re thinking about waiting until later to g
 et your tickets… don’t! This beloved event sells out every year! Gener
 ously sponsored by Coldwell Banker\n\nSources: North of Boston\nEvent page
 : https://northofboston.org/event/historic-beverly-annual-holiday-house-to
 ur/
LOCATION:John Cabot House\, 117 Cabot St.\, Beverly\, MA\, 01915
URL:https://northofboston.org/event/historic-beverly-annual-holiday-house-
 tour/
END:VEVENT
