 es across the nation. Embark on a journey through the Best of Elvis\, wher
 e iconic hits from “Can’t Help Falling in Love” to “Jailhouse Rock
 \,” “Hound Dog\,” “Love Me Tender\,” and more chart-topping clas
 sics will transport you to an unforgettable era. This Christmas Special al
 so features Elvis’s holiday favorites\, including “Blue Christmas\,”
  “White Christmas\,” “Winter Wonderland\,” “Merry Christmas Baby
 \,” “Santa Claus Is Back in Town\,” and “I’ll Be Home for Christ
 mas.” Robert Black’s remarkable emulation and magnetic stage presence
 \, coupled with his exceptional vocal prowess\, breathe life back into the
  essence of Elvis. Brace yourself for an evening brimming with nostalgia-i
 nducing melodies\, holiday cheer\, and the undeniable spirit of the King! 
 Don’t miss out on this remarkable Christmas tribute to the King of Rock 
 ‘n’ Roll. Date: Saturday\, December 12\, 2026 Time: 8:00 PM\; Doors & 
 Bar 7:00 PM Tickets: $29 | $31 | $36 Venue: Larcom Theatre\, 13 Wallis St.
