UID:b9a401ef1be49f7842c5e46487dbc5@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:This event is FREE and open to everyone! Join us for a beautif
 ul evening of carols\, accompanied by our restored historic Tracker Organ 
 and Steinway piano! Please bring a donation for the Yarmouth Food Pantry. 
 Donations of cash\, checks\, grocery/cash gift cards\, as well as non-peri
 shable food items (please check dates) frozen meat\, and vegetables will b
 e accepted. All donations will be delivered to the Yarmouth Food Pantry. T
 he Yarmouth Food Pantry has over 12\,000 registrants is is serving more co
 mmunity members than ever. Please be as generous as you can and help us su
 pport this great community resources! Items requested by the pantry: soups
 \, stews\, chili\, jelly\, squash and other hearty vegetables\, small bags
  of rice. Featured performers: Kim Alizi\, piano\; Elizabeth Bader\, organ
 \; Don Barry\, emcee. PLEASE RSVP for this event so that we can prepare ac
 cordingly!\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodch
 amber.org/event/annual-holiday-caroling/52672/
