DTSTAMP:20261119T195526Z
UID:13da6f595877bd6bc135b532113b8a@massachusetts-events
DESCRIPTION:Discover the artistry of Nantucket Lightship Basket weaving in
  a hands-on workshop led by artisan Abby Fisher of Fisher Nantuckets. Expl
 ore the history of this time-honored craft as you learn traditional weavin
 g techniques and create your own ½-inch Nantucket bracelet\, complete wit
 h your choice of acrylic end caps. Discover more here: Woven Traditions: N
 antucket Bracelet Workshop | Wequassett\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEven
 t page: https://www.capecodchamber.org/event/woven-traditions%3a-nantucket
