 eauty at the Church of the Transfiguration. The music includes Corelli’s
  Christmas Concerto \, Bach\, Handel\, Patapan! and In Dulci Jubilo —cal
 ling to mind the mysteries and merriment of that Holy Night. Info: 508-240
 -2400 | artsempoweringlife.org (Free for Students and youth 18 & under)\n
