DESCRIPTION:Get ready for a festive afternoon filled with holiday cheer\, 
 music\, and dancing! ❤️💚 Join us for a special holiday dance perfor
 mance as part of our Holidays in the Hangar 2026 celebration! Free Parking
 .\n\nSources: Cape Cod Chamber\nEvent page: https://www.capecodchamber.org
 /event/holidays-in-the-hanger%3a-holiday-dancers/52834/
